# symdraw: drawing in the square pane is mirrored eight ways. A left drag inside the restricted wedge draws free-hand (the handler moves
# &x and &y into the pane's coordinates by -:=), a middle drag draws a straight line, the restrict button lifts the wedge so a drag
# elsewhere draws too, clear erases the pane, meta q quits. The pane's corner stands at 107 47; the wedge is x >= y, both under 200.
drag 1 257 97 297 167
wait
move 287 77
press 2
move 300 100
move 297 140
release 2
wait
click 1 52 175
wait
drag 1 400 380 450 300
wait
click 1 52 55
wait
drag 1 250 80 290 120
wait
move 300 300
keydown Alt_L
key q
keyup Alt_L
